fireplace_crackle (timeless): A crackling fire in a room, soft pops. Must not contain: people, engines, thunder.
kitchen_busy (historic): A kitchen at work: pots, chopping, sizzling. Must not contain: music, engines, sirens, radio.
office_hum (modern): A modern office: HVAC hum, keyboards, a faint phone. Must not contain: sirens, music, speech, traffic.
library_quiet (timeless): A library: near silence, a page turned now and then, soft room tone. Must not contain: music, engines, sirens, crowd, speech.
hospital_ward (modern): A hospital ward: distant monitors, carts, a low voice. Must not contain: sirens, music, shouting.
