cafe_soft (modern): A quiet cafe: soft chatter and cups clinking. Must not contain: music, sirens, traffic.
lecture_hall (modern): A lecture hall: a quiet audience rustle and distant ventilation. Must not contain: music, sirens, shouting, speech.
forge_anvil (historic): A blacksmith's forge: hammer on anvil, bellows, a crackling fire. Must not contain: engines, power tools, sirens, music, radio.
horse_trot (historic): A horse trotting on a dirt road: hooves, a light tack creak. Must not contain: cars, engines, traffic, sirens, speech.
horse_gallop (historic): A horse galloping: pounding hooves, breath and leather. Must not contain: cars, engines, traffic, sirens, speech.
carriage_wheels (historic): A wooden carriage on a road: wheels creaking, harness jingle. Must not contain: cars, engines, traffic, sirens, music.
ship_deck (historic): A wooden sailing ship at sea: ropes, a creaking hull, flapping sails. Must not contain: engines, sirens, music, speech.
train_interior (modern): A train carriage: rhythmic wheels on rail, a muffled cabin. Must not contain: sirens, music, announcements, shouting.
