subway_platform (modern): An underground platform: a train far off and an echoing hall. Must not contain: music, sirens, announcements.
battle_field (historic): A distant battle: shouts, clashing metal, horns. Must not contain: gunfire, engines, sirens, music.
war_drums (historic): Drums and horns of an approaching army, tense. Must not contain: melody, songs, engines, sirens, speech.
