ritual_chant (historic): Low chanted voices in a ritual, reverberant. Must not contain: instruments, engines, sirens, radio.
temple_incense (historic): A temple interior: soft bells and hushed chanting. Must not contain: instruments, engines, sirens, radio.
monastery_chant (historic): Monks chanting in a stone hall, long reverberant tones. Must not contain: instruments, engines, sirens, radio.
qi_hum (timeless): A cultivation aura: a low resonant hum, soft wind, a faint shimmer. Must not contain: music, speech, engines, sirens.
spirit_whispers (timeless): Faint, eerie air with unplaceable low tones. Must not contain: speech, music, engines, sirens.
starship_bridge (futuristic): A spaceship bridge: a low electronic hum and faint console tones. Must not contain: music, speech, sirens.
spaceship_engine (futuristic): A deep engine rumble in a spaceship corridor. Must not contain: music, speech, sirens.
alien_atmosphere (futuristic): An alien planet: strange wind, unfamiliar chirps, a low drone. Must not contain: music, speech, sirens, human voices.
space_station (futuristic): A space station: steady air handling and distant clanks. Must not contain: music, speech, sirens.
tense_heartbeat (timeless): A muffled heartbeat under near silence, for explicit suspense only. Must not contain: music, engines, sirens, speech.
clock_ticking (historic): A slow pendulum clock ticking in a quiet room. Must not contain: music, engines, sirens, speech.
ominous_drone (timeless): A low, dark drone in a still, cold room, for a horror tone. Must not contain: music, speech, engines, sirens.
ballroom_party (historic): A ballroom or party murmur: glasses and distant chatter, no music. Must not contain: music, engines, sirens, radio.
rain_on_window (timeless): Rain against window glass, heard from a warm room. Must not contain: thunder, people, traffic, engines."
